 280:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_pwr.c ****       (+) RTC auto-wakeup (AWU) from the Stop, Standby and Shutdown modes
 281:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_pwr.c **** 
